  ✓ Check program fidelity and run independent Python differential tests
  ✓ Copy sources to scratch, rebuild K definitions, and independently run every positive claim
  ✓ Audit claim adequacy, real-program pinning, and concrete satisfying witnesses
  ✓ Build exhaustive declarations/rules/constructs inventory and assess static soundness
  ✓ Create and run a fresh false result mutation for non-vacuity
  → Write proven-versus-assumed accounting, evidence index, and final REVIEW.md verdict
